      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "View Mode - Card vs Table",
      "id": "view-mode",
      "intro": "Alert Acquirer support 2 mode tampilan: Card View dan Table View. User bisa toggle sesuai preferensi untuk melihat alert dalam format yang berbeda.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Card View vs Table View",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Card View**: Tampilan card dengan visual rich, cocok untuk quick scan\n• **Table View**: Tampilan tabel compact, cocok untuk compare multiple alerts\n• Toggle di header toolbar menggunakan button icon\n• Preferensi view tersimpan di local storage\n• Detail panel tetap muncul di kanan (Card) atau bawah (Table)",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">View Mode</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Card & Table Toggle</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"none\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg>Card</button><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>Table</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Card View - Visual Rich",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Cards ditampilkan dalam grid layout\n• Setiap card menampilkan:\n  - Alert ID & Case Score (prominent)\n  - Classification badge (color-coded)\n  - Alert Date & SLA Status\n  - Assigned To info\n  - Lock status indicator\n  - Quick action buttons\n• Click card untuk select & view detail di panel kanan\n• Visual cues: border highlight untuk selected, dashed untuk bulked",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Card View</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #3b82f6;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(59,130,246,0.1);cursor:pointer;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12345</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">SUSPICIOUS</span></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#3b82f6;margin-bottom:6px;\">Score: 85/100</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\">📅 2024-01-15 14:30</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\">👤 John Analyst</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">⚡ SLA: On Time</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;cursor:pointer;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12346</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">NEGATIVE</span></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:6px;\">Score: 45/100</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\">📅 2024-01-15 13:15</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\">👤 Sarah Investigator</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">⚡ SLA: On Time</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Table View - Compact & Compare",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Alerts ditampilkan dalam table rows\n• Columns:\n  - Alert ID\n  - Case Score\n  - Classification\n  - Alert Date\n  - Assigned To\n  - SLA Status\n  - Lock Status\n  - Actions\n• Sortable by column headers\n• Row click untuk select & expand detail di bawah\n• Compact view untuk lihat banyak alerts sekaligus",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;background:#f8fafc;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Table View</span></div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#eef2ff;border-bottom:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;color:#4338ca;\">Alert ID</th><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;color:#4338ca;\">Score</th><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;color:#4338ca;\">Classification</th><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;color:#4338ca;\">Date</th><th style=\"padding:8px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;color:#4338ca;\">Assigned</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12345</td><td style=\"padding:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">85</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">SUSPICIOUS</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#64748b;\">2024-01-15</td><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#64748b;\">John</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;background:#f8fafc;cursor:pointer;\"><td style=\"padding:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12346</td><td style=\"padding:8px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">45</td><td style=\"padding:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">NEGATIVE</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#64748b;\">2024-01-15</td><td style=\"padding:8px;color:#64748b;\">Sarah</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Toggle View Mode",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Segmented control button di toolbar header\n• Click **Card** atau **Table** untuk switch\n• Smooth transition animation\n• Selected view di-highlight dengan background color\n• Preferensi tersimpan otomatis\n• Reload page akan restore last view mode",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alert Acquirer</span><div style=\"display:inline-flex;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:2px;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#8b5cf6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;transition:all 0.2s;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"none\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg>Card</button><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;transition:all 0.2s;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"/></svg>Table</button></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;padding:20px;\">💡 Click Card or Table button to switch view mode</div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
